-- =====================================================================
-- fin-seed.sql — MOLIYA ISH REJASI, 1a-BOSQICH: BOSHLANG'ICH MA'LUMOTNOMALAR (docs/moliya/buxgalteriya-ish-reja.md §4.2, §4.4, §4.5).
--   Ishchi hisobvaraqlar rejasi (BHMS 21), statiyalar katalogi (IN 7, EX 44, OP 24 = 75), «Buxgalteriya»dagi 21 eski toifa → statiya
--   mosligi, kassa operatsiyalari qoidalari.
--   HAMMASI «ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING»: qayta ishga tushirilganda (har deploy) MAVJUD qator o'zgarmaydi — buxgalter/Direktor kiritgan
--   tuzatish saqlanadi. Mavjud qatorni o'zgartirish kerak bo'lsa — alohida, aniq UPDATE bilan (sababi yozilgan holda).
--   HOLAT: run-all.sql'da «--dev \ir» — prod'ga hali chiqmaydi.
-- =====================================================================

-- ---------- 1) Ishchi hisobvaraqlar rejasi (§4.2). kind: A aktiv, P passiv, KA kontraktiv, T tranzit, BT balansdan tashqari, X texnik ----------
on conflict (code) do nothing;

-- ---------- 2) Statiyalar katalogi (§4.4): IN 7, EX 44, OP 24 = 75. "accountCode" — bitta standart hisobvaraq ----------
on conflict (id) do nothing;

-- ---------- 3) «Buxgalteriya» bo'limidagi 21 eski xarajat toifasi → standart statiya (§4.4 «Moslik») ----------
on conflict (category) do nothing;

-- ---------- 4) Kassa operatsiyalari qoidalari (§4.5) ----------
